      2365.142333984375,
      1654.2261962890623,
      2466.5048828125
    ],
    "content": "z^{\\prime}=\\frac{1}{z}=\\frac{a}{a^{2}+b^{2}}+\\mathrm{i}\\frac{-b}{a^{2}+b^{2}}=\\frac{a-\\mathrm{i}b}{a^{2}+b^{2}}."
