    "content": "\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l l}{a a^{\\prime}-b b^{\\prime}=1}&{\\left(L_{1}\\right)}\\\\ {a b^{\\prime}+b a^{\\prime}=0}&{\\left(L_{2}\\right)}\\end{array}\\right."
